{"v":4,"catch":"為了在地獄生存的生存動作RPG! \n使用各種物品，各種技能收集5塊煉獄石吧！","desc":"以前有了內涵強大的魔力的5塊煉獄之石。\n各國家擁有一個煉獄石，保持了世界力量的平衡。\n但是，世界的歪曲越時間過去越強大了。\n煉獄石從弱者的心裡開始支配。\n人們變成魔物，世界崩壞了。\n\n從那天100年後...\n與死神契約的，不知不純的靈魂開眼。\n\n這是「地獄」世界的故事。","publisher":"ARC SYSTEM WORKS","release":"2019-05-16","genres":["角色扮演","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 2.0GB / Switch 2.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb271b5d59ffd1fb64c9109a423b6737e9d07f8ccd0d6ee9ee945639db6ea970.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a0470cb9ab6f416d159c8f9aff690d38a4f8245557fbb24de892469a4524011.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46fae05299d8530278023d4845c278d53a61481e7f202e7acd84555a97c502bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34b0ee56a98d7558cccd36031318182e4c905423c11929256548911ab53b81be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f31239467315b18ff8045acd70d5b9612762775e59e7767a142fb6d9b5dbdb7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3bd7792ba0163ea37c6ca86571b71b30a8cc7ed096023cdc9db947c65b6ca8eb.jpg"],"titleId":"010086300a558000","dlc":[]}